Version: 1.0
desc: Lumina Channel Strip (port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Channel strip: HPF/LPF, gate, analog EQ, compressor, saturation, limiter, true peak metering.
  DSP ports of the original plugins (not of the standalone versions):
  HPF/LPF: Ported from x42/fil4.lv2 (Robin Gareus). GPLv2+.
  https://github.com/x42/fil4.lv2
  Gate: Ported from ZamGateX2 (zam-plugins). GPLv2+.
  https://github.com/zamaudio/zam-plugins
  Analog EQ: Ported from Luftikus (lkjb). MIT.
  https://github.com/lkjbdsp/lkjb-plugins/tree/master/Luftikus
  Compressor: Ported from x42/darc.lv2 (Robin Gareus). GPLv2+.
  https://github.com/x42/darc.lv2
  Saturation: DSP from Airwindows ChannelX by Chris Johnson (MIT License).
  https://github.com/airwindows/airwindows/tree/master/plugins/LinuxVST/src/ChannelX
  Limiter & True Peak metering: Ported from x42/dpl.lv2 (Robin Gareus; DSP by Fons Adriaensen). GPLv3+.
  https://github.com/x42/dpl.lv2
  JSFX port by chmaha. GPLv3.
  Claude generated some of this code

